0:03:20.00 --> 0:07:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Soldiers are attacked by a tribe. We see dead tribal soldiers on the ground. A man is hung from a crucifix. The soldiers are attacked with spears and swords. Many soldiers are killed. A tribal warrior is strangled.)

0:14:00.00 --> 0:15:10.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A man buries his wife. A gorilla herd corners him. They attack and kill him. The infant is adopted by a gorilla.)

0:19:20.00 --> 0:20:30.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: The gorilla leader grabs and attacks Tarzan. The mother rescues him.)

