0:36:10.00 --> 0:37:20.00
sex 2 (SceneRadar: Tarzan smells the hair of a woman. He then sniffs her face - and then her crotch. She tries pushing him away. They later kiss. Sex is implied.)

0:37:30.00 --> 0:39:10.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Tribal soldiers are captured by mercenaries. When the chief refuses to kneel, he is shot dead. Tarzan is captured by the mercenaries.)

0:40:20.00 --> 0:42:05.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Two men are shot down. The group returns fire. Tarzan manages to escape. The group escape in a boat. The two sides exchange fire.)

