1:13:00.00 --> 1:14:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A cage with a native is dropped in water. The woman slams a guard and jumps in the water. Hippos charge at the duo. They manage to escape.)

1:15:30.00 --> 1:24:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: The woman lands in ape territory. She is followed by the mercenaries. An ape is shot dead. The other apes attack. Tarzan saves a charging ape. Some men are killed by the apes. In in a flashback scene, an ape is hit by an arrow and passes in Tarzan's arms. In a fit of rage, Tarzan attacks and kills the attacker. The tribal soldiers attack Tarzan. Tarzan slams the chief and then points a knife at his throat.)

1:29:15.00 --> 1:36:20.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a stampede. Animals charge at a camp. The building collapses. A few men are run over by the stampeding animals. A man fires a machine gun at a boat - causing many holes in the hull. The boat starts sinking. A crew member is dragged away by a crocodile. Tarzan is choked from behind - but he disarms his attacker and throws him overboard. A crocodile attacks the man and kills him. The boat explodes.)

